shelf adapts mechanisms from two GPLv3 menu bar managers. It copies no
files from them. The adapted parts are the private WindowServer calls,
the window-capture call for icon pictures, the event fields and geometry
of a synthetic menu bar drag, and the second "source-anchored" drag.

