Files in shelf that adapt these mechanisms:
  Sources/shelf/WindowServer.swift   private WindowServer calls and icon capture
  Sources/shelf/Mover.swift          the synthetic Command-drag that moves an icon

Comments in these files name the upstream project for each mechanism.
